{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14716","headline":"送李观之宣州谒袁中丞赋得三州渡 · 张衆甫","name":"送李观之宣州谒袁中丞赋得三州渡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古渡大江滨，西南距要津。\n自当舟檝路，应济往来人。\n翻浪惊飞鸟，回风起绿苹。\n君看波上客，岁晚独垂纶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张衆甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14716.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14716","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}